{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8771c82eedc14bc6","name":"Veteran Clone Trooper","source":{"id":"source:reference-8771c82eedc14bc6","title":"Veteran Clone Trooper","revision":19603,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:15:46Z","sha256":"51379de233b1b4a05c7ae44be01c0f0568353f30e68351a4313fcc424e5f230f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19603","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Veteran%20Clone%20Trooper&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8771c82eedc14bc6","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Aging at twice the rate of an average ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"},", the original ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Troopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Troopers"}," are a rapidly vanishing force throughout ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Times"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Times"},". As they get older, they become less useful as frontline troops. The effects of aging begin to set in, and though they have years of hard combat experience under their belts, their bodies are beginning to decline. The reality of their advanced aging is something that few members of the Republic ever truly stopped to consider, and in the years following ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"}," the Empire must deal with the harsh reality that a large number of its veteran troops are becoming less useful on the battlefield every day.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["However, the Empire is not about to let any resource go to waste, and certainly not one as experienced as the Clone Troopers. Aging Clone Troopers are regularly cycled out of frontline units and reassigned to garrisoned posts or less volatile regions. In more peaceful areas, it hardly matters that the individual filling out the armor is no longer a crack soldier. The most experienced and capable are used for training new Stormtrooper units or other Imperial forces. However, few of these Veteran Clone Troopers are capable of embracing a life behind a desk or in a training center, leading many of them to fight with suicidal recklessness rather than grow old while training nonclone recruits.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Veteran Clone Trooper Statistics (CL 3)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," (Middle Age) ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +11; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low-Light_Vision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +12\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Langu